"Invalid moveItemModifiers “%@” in config.json" = "config.json 中的 moveItemModifiers“%@”无效";
"Use modifiers like \"cmd\", \"alt\" or \"ctrl+alt\", or \"\" to turn moving items off." = "请使用 \"cmd\"、\"alt\" 或 \"ctrl+alt\" 等修饰键，或用 \"\" 关闭项目移动。";
"move an item in History (pinned items: change their order)" = "在历史记录中移动项目（置顶项目：更改其顺序）";
"%@ commands for %@ selected items — ↩ runs on each · %@ generators · Esc back" = "%2$@ 个所选项目有 %1$@ 个命令——↩ 逐个运行 · %3$@ 生成器 · Esc 返回";
"Input: %@ selected items, each run separately" = "输入：%@ 个所选项目，逐个运行";
"Could not save the sequence" = "无法存储序列";
"“%@” stopped" = "“%@”已停止";
"A quote in the sequence isn't closed." = "序列中有未闭合的引号。";
"commands.json isn't a JSON list." = "commands.json 不是 JSON 列表。";
"Unknown step “%@”. Use item 1, \"text\", wait 200, or a key like tab, enter or cmd+a." = "未知步骤“%@”。请使用 item 1、\"文本\"、wait 200，或 tab、enter、cmd+a 等按键。";
"A sequence pastes the selected items one after another, with keys and pauses in between. item 1…n are the items selected when you run it, in the order you selected them. Steps: item 1, \"text\", wait 200 (ms), or a key like tab, enter, shift+tab or cmd+a." = "序列会依次粘贴所选项目，中间可加入按键和停顿。item 1…n 是运行时所选的项目，按你选择的顺序排列。步骤：item 1、\"文本\"、wait 200（毫秒），或 tab、enter、shift+tab、cmd+a 等按键。";
"Name, e.g. Fill login form" = "名称，例如：填写登录表单";
"Save as Sequence" = "存储为序列";
"Save as Sequence…" = "存储为序列…";
"Sequence: %@" = "序列：%@";
"Another app came to the front, so the sequence stopped." = "另一个 App 来到了前台，因此序列已停止。";
"Clipsie needs the Accessibility permission to paste." = "Clipsie 需要“辅助功能”权限才能粘贴。";
"Could not write to the clipboard." = "无法写入剪贴板。";
"Sequences" = "序列";
"Select items (⌘-click or ⇧↓) and choose Save as Sequence… in the right-click menu. A sequence pastes item 1…n of your selection with keys and pauses in between, e.g. to fill a form. It's a command in commands.json:" = "选择项目（⌘-点按或 ⇧↓），然后在右键菜单中选择“存储为序列…”。序列会粘贴所选的 item 1…n，中间可加入按键和停顿，例如用来填写表单。它是 commands.json 中的一条命令：";
"Commands on several items: \"multiple\": \"each\" runs once per item (default), \"all\" once on all texts joined with \"separator\"." = "对多个项目运行命令：\"multiple\": \"each\" 对每个项目运行一次（默认），\"all\" 将所有文本用 \"separator\" 连接后运行一次。";
"the 1st selected item (in the order you selected)" = "第 1 个所选项目（按选择顺序）";
"this text" = "这段文本";
"pause 200 ms (also 0.5s)" = "停顿 200 毫秒（也可写 0.5s）";
"press a key" = "按一个键";
"Resize image to 50%" = "将图像缩小到 50%";
"Resize image to fit 1024 px" = "将图像缩放到 1024 像素以内";
"Rotate image right" = "向右旋转图像";
"Rotate image left" = "向左旋转图像";
"Flip image horizontally" = "水平翻转图像";
"Make image grayscale" = "将图像转为灰度";
"Convert image to JPEG" = "将图像转换为 JPEG";
"Convert image to PNG" = "将图像转换为 PNG";
"Copy image as data URL" = "将图像拷贝为 data URL";
"Image items come with item.image (width, height). Return an image and the output (paste, copy, newItem, replace) is an image too. Built-in: resize, rotate, flip, grayscale, convert, copy as data URL." = "图像项目带有 item.image（width、height）。脚本返回图像时，输出（paste、copy、newItem、replace）也是图像。内置：缩放、旋转、翻转、灰度、转换、拷贝为 data URL。";
"clockwise, in steps of 90°; flip(img, \"vertical\")" = "顺时针，以 90° 为步长；flip(img, \"vertical\")";
"png, jpeg, heic, tiff; { quality: 0.8 }" = "png、jpeg、heic、tiff；{ quality: 0.8 }";
"text like data:image/png;base64,…; also grayscale(img)" = "形如 data:image/png;base64,… 的文本；还有 grayscale(img)";
"text, rich, image, file, link, color, other; default: items with text or files" = "text、rich、image、file、link、color、other；默认：含文本或文件的项目";
"width, height, max (longest side) or scale" = "width、height、max（最长边）或 scale";
"x, y (from the top left), width, height" = "x、y（从左上角起），width、height";
"Could not create the image." = "无法创建图像。";
"Could not encode the image." = "无法编码图像。";
"Image size %@×%@ is out of range." = "图像尺寸 %1$@×%2$@ 超出范围。";
"Not an image; use item.image." = "不是图像；请使用 item.image。";
"The crop area is outside the image." = "裁剪区域超出了图像范围。";
"Unknown image format “%@”; use png, jpeg, heic or tiff." = "未知的图像格式“%@”；请使用 png、jpeg、heic 或 tiff。";
"crop needs x, y, width and height." = "crop 需要 x、y、width 和 height。";
"resize needs width, height, max or scale." = "resize 需要 width、height、max 或 scale。";
"rotate only turns by multiples of 90 degrees." = "rotate 只能按 90 度的倍数旋转。";
"Search (?? help, %@ item commands, %@ generators, %@ sequences)" = "搜索（?? 帮助，%1$@ 项目命令，%2$@ 生成器，%3$@ 序列）";
"Commands for the selected item: %@ or %@\nGenerators: %@ or %@\nSequences: %@" = "所选项目的命令：%1$@ 或 %2$@\n生成器：%3$@ 或 %4$@\n序列：%5$@";
"%@ sequences — ↩ runs on %@ selected items · Esc back" = "%1$@ 个序列——↩ 以 %2$@ 个所选项目运行 · Esc 返回";
"Run sequences with %@ or the right-click menu. With fewer items selected than a sequence uses, it stops at the first missing item." = "用 %@ 或右键菜单运行序列。如果所选项目少于序列所用的数量，序列会在第一个缺少的项目处停止。";
